 "summary": "A series of four-diode single-phase bridge rectifiers in a small four-lead plastic surface-mount package (ABS), rated 2.0 A average output and 60 A surge. Seven voltage grades run from 50 V to 1000 V repetitive peak reverse voltage. ABS210 is the 1000 V grade.",
